WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:05.230
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this is my
Teen Wolf episode 11 video.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:09.480
Next week is the finale so after I get through
all the craziness from this week I’ll explain

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:11.660
when Season 5 is going to start.

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.880
Right now there are a number of ways the finale
can still go down, so I’ll add my favorite

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.570
theories after my review.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.780
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.800
But here’s my top 5 wtf moments.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.630
I’ll wait just a sec...okay.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:23.730
Here we go.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.070
Number 5 - Deaton is Back

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:29.810
Seth Gilliam has been filming Walking Dead
Season 5, that’s why he hasn’t been in

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.439
every episode this season.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:35.579
People die way more frequently on that show,
so the odds he’d totally bail on Teen Wolf

00:00:35.579 --> 00:00:39.620
are very slim.

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:44.589
Daniel Sharman for instance, asked specifically
to not be killed off when he left to do Originals.

00:00:44.589 --> 00:00:46.440
So actors can always come back if they’re
not confirmed dead.

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:48.960
I totally dug the Hannibal Lecter thing he
and Valick had going on.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:53.230
I’m gonna go ahead and guess he wasn’t
a medical doctor.

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:59.150
If you didn’t catch the Trepanation reference,
Trepanning is the practice of drilling or

00:00:59.150 --> 00:01:05.299
scraping a small piece of the skull away to
expose your outer brain matter as a means

00:01:05.299 --> 00:01:07.370
to relieve pressure.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:10.810
There’s evidence that neolithic humans practiced
it.

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:13.550
That was around 10,000 BC.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:14.800
Yeah, long time ago.

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:18.470
It was the era when humans started to develop
tools.

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:21.330
Apparently so that the could use them to bore
holes in peoples heads.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:23.600
Teen Wolf History lessons for the win!

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:27.320
The reason Valick did it seemed more a way
to expose his third eye whenever he manifested

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.110
psionic powers.

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:33.130
If you didn’t notice, the place where Deaton
went in the dream state was the same underground

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:42.020
temple in mexico where Kate was hiding out
and where they found Derek in the premiere.

00:01:42.020 --> 00:01:51.251
They haven’t fully explained Kate’s magic
yet, so I’m hoping the finale clears up

00:01:51.251 --> 00:01:55.181
some of the mechanics.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.510
Other major reveal was the woman deaton loved.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.230
I’m guessing that was Derek’s mother.

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:04.020
That sounds like a teaser for a season 5 story
unless I’m forgetting something.

00:02:04.020 --> 00:02:08.440
on to Number 4 - Derek doesn’t care about
the money

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:12.310
Mostly because the money was never his, it’s
all peter’s like Stiles thought.

00:02:12.310 --> 00:02:16.010
Derek’s money for all intents and purposes
has always been safe.

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:19.650
He owns the loft and the rest is all in a
series of bank accounts.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:24.180
I love that he suggests Scott keep the money.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:31.060
It sounds like Derek doesn’t trust Peter
with it.

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:40.279
Which makes me feel like Stiles Eichenhouse
debt wasn’t forgiven, Scott paid it off

00:02:40.279 --> 00:02:42.610
and manufactured the letter to Stiles dad.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.959
Unless Stiles was faking and he wrote the
letter.

00:02:44.959 --> 00:02:48.599
Either way I don’t think Peter is getting
that money back.

00:02:48.599 --> 00:02:54.610
I thought for a minute when derek was explaining
he owned the building that the show was teasing

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:59.019
it might move Scott in as a way to solve some
money problems.

00:02:59.019 --> 00:03:02.849
Like, we don’t need to fix our roof because
we live in Derek’s building rent free now.

00:03:02.849 --> 00:03:06.579
I don’t think that’s going to happen,
Scott and Kira’s date was really the follow

00:03:06.579 --> 00:03:07.579
up to that.

00:03:07.579 --> 00:03:08.779
That’s as close as they’re getting to
living together in the loft.

00:03:08.779 --> 00:03:10.859
On to Number 3 - Liam is still Flipping out

00:03:10.859 --> 00:03:14.659
It’s pretty clear they’re preparing him
for a big turnaround in the finale.

00:03:14.659 --> 00:03:17.290
The full moon is a problem because he still
can’t control his shifts and it’s only

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:18.879
24 hours away.

00:03:18.879 --> 00:03:24.529
That’s just the show saying the finale will
be a full moon so everything will be totally

00:03:24.529 --> 00:03:25.529
crazy.

00:03:25.529 --> 00:03:30.599
I’m going to be happy to see Liam not space
out anymore.

00:03:30.599 --> 00:03:36.120
It’s one of the few stories this season
that I haven’t had fun with.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:44.440
He is the new guy, so I get why he can’t
just automatically be an amazing werewolf.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:50.010
He has to overcome a struggle to earn his
wolf stripes.

00:03:50.010 --> 00:03:53.599
Usually surviving traumatic events together
is what brings everyone together.

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:56.300
Which Kate and Peter are more than happy to
supply.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.749
There was this whole thing going on in the
episode where moments kept reminding us of

00:03:59.749 --> 00:04:05.049
the relationship between fear, anger and strength.

00:04:05.049 --> 00:04:08.879
Liam going all bro-dude in the weightroom
was a good reminder that the more angry he

00:04:08.879 --> 00:04:10.299
is, the stronger he gets.

00:04:10.299 --> 00:04:12.409
Like sliding scale of Hulk.

00:04:12.409 --> 00:04:16.430
I’m betting that in the finale he’ll find
the motivation to stay pissed off enough to

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:18.070
destroy the berserkers.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:23.240
Scott will always be the most powerful because
of his alpha abilities, but Liam is the next

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.680
most strong because of his rage face.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.380
I was happy to see Brett help him out.

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.350
There’s a chance he might help out in the
finale too.

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:38.420
Especially if Satomi gets involved.

00:04:38.420 --> 00:04:42.760
On to Number 2 - Peter Wants Malia To Kill
Kate

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:46.910
This got me really excited at the thought
she might go through with it.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:49.800
Not because she wants to help Peter, but because
she’ll have to save Scott.

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:54.350
They’ve already established how protective
of Scott she is and she’s not fully integrated

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:55.700
into human society.

00:04:55.700 --> 00:05:03.350
Character-wise, she’s in a limbo state where
she could be totally copacetic at the thought

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:06.200
of killing a villain as bad as Kate.

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.470
She might even feel like it’s justified.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:10.950
Peter giving off his creepo vibes is really
the only thing that made the plan sound sinister.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:16.430
But who else loved Peter’s reaction to the
Desert Wolf.

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:17.910
Positive she’s you’re mother.

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:19.530
I can’t wait to learn about that history.

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:22.020
I doesn’t sound like we’ll meet her in
the finale.

00:05:22.020 --> 00:05:24.590
At least by season 5.

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:30.470
I’m hoping that Malia goes through with
the kill, then spends most of season 5 dealing

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:31.500
with what she’s done.

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.980
And it takes her mother to help set her right
again.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:37.060
Like the remorse for killing kate will be
more than Stiles alone can help her with.

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.780
It will be something she needs her mother
for.

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:43.880
I can already imagine the awkward family dinner
with Peter, The Desert Wolf and Malia.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:48.580
I wonder if Derek would just go hide out and
avoid the whole thing all together.

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:53.230
and my Number 1 WTF Moment - Kate Turns Scott
Into A Berserker

00:05:53.230 --> 00:05:56.940
Or at least she’s going to turn him into
something that looks like a berserker.

00:05:56.940 --> 00:05:59.290
It’s still so unclear as to what’s involved
in that.

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:04.800
I’m guessing Deaton will explain that part.

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:11.600
Remember though Scott went crazy Alpha form
last week, I think that was just the beginning.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:15.890
I’m hoping we get to see him full on hulk
out Peter Alpha style and just smash the hell

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:16.970
out of the temple.

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:21.860
Presumably Deaton knows what’s happened
to Derek too, and I’m guessing saving scott,

00:06:21.860 --> 00:06:25.940
fixing derek and liam fixing himself will
all tie in with Malia killing kate.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:31.420
I don’t know that just killing her will
fix everything, it wouldn’t be that simple,

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:36.432
but I’m wondering if Kate is using Derek’s
mojo to power the berserker transformations.

00:06:36.432 --> 00:06:37.432
Like that’s the energy consumed to transform
them.

00:06:37.432 --> 00:06:42.280
Scott’s arc this season has been dancing
around the idea of him becoming a monster.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:46.320
Him hallucinating killing liam in his dream
state makes a lot more sense now.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:54.500
That might have been a premonition for whatever
he’ll be like under kate’s influence.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:58.860
If Peter is going to try and steal his powers
I think the circumstances of his death are

00:06:58.860 --> 00:06:59.860
important.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:08.550
So if his friends kill him like Kate wants,
I think that will botch Peter’s plan.

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:10.980
Which might be why Peter is enlisting Malia’s
help.

00:07:10.980 --> 00:07:11.980
Just as a backup.

00:07:11.980 --> 00:07:15.090
Anyway, let me know what your biggest wtf
from the episode was.

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:17.970
And do you actually think kate will be able
to turn Scott.

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:20.990
Or was that final moment a total fake out.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:24.250
Like maybe Scott will hulk out at the last
second.

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:27.730
Here are a couple of my bigger predictions.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:30.930
Peter will not take Scott’s Power, but he
will steal someone’s power.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:38.220
Malia might not end up killing Kate, but she
will do something to mentally scar herself.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:40.390
And Scott will go into his full on Alpha Form.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.280
He’ll look like a version of what Peter
looked like.

00:07:43.280 --> 00:07:44.280
Super huge.

00:07:44.280 --> 00:07:47.830
And we’ll finally see Parrish manifest his
power.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:53.470
I know I didn’t mention it in the episode,
but his eyes flashed red, so we’ll finally

00:07:53.470 --> 00:07:55.180
find out what his powers are.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.060
I’m guessing they’ll be fire-related.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:07:59.350
The title of the finale is The Broken Spell.

00:07:59.350 --> 00:08:06.030
So it implies they’ll break the spell Kate
put on Derek too.

00:08:06.030 --> 00:08:16.310
Overall I gave the episode a B plus, I liked
the Trashy Romance novel motif they set up.

00:08:16.310 --> 00:08:19.140
They kind of dropped that about halfway through
the episode.

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:20.320
The Kira/Scott date was were it ended.

00:08:20.320 --> 00:08:24.790
I tried to read the titles of all those books
Doctor Valick had, I only saw “The Afternoon

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:28.250
Wife, Love’s Passion, Hawaiian Honeymoon”.

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:30.870
Maybe there’s a teaser in there.

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:35.210
Like between the finale and Season 5 some
of the characters will go on vacation to hawaii,

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:38.440
the afternoon wife could be a reference to
malia’s mother.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:42.340
I guess you could also just think of them
as visual references for all the trashy romance

00:08:42.340 --> 00:08:46.520
novel moments in the episode, like when it
jumped from couple to couple.

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:51.700
Derek and Braeden, Stiles and Malia, and scott
and kira.

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:57.630
I could totally see Braeden taking Derek to
hawaii during the off season.

00:08:57.630 --> 00:09:00.240
I think the episodes in season 4 have done
a really good job of developing each of the

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:05.930
characters in a way that gives them places
to go in season 5 and beyond.

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:11.670
I don’t see the show going past 7 seasons
but if they can gain the type of audience

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.120
Supernatural has, they can go forever.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.700
Especially if they can keep bringing in new
characters like Liam.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.290
Dylan Sprayberry could totally take over as
an alpha someday if Scott had a reason to

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:24.520
leave town (like if Tyler Posey left the show
for some reason).

00:09:24.520 --> 00:09:26.510
That’s a good thought to end on.

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:28.960
How many seasons do you think Teen Wolf will
get?

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:30.640
I expect to at least see season 6.

00:09:30.640 --> 00:09:35.510
They wouldn’t have upped the order from
12 to 20 between season 4 and 5 if MTV didn’t

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.350
feel confident about the show.

00:09:37.350 --> 00:09:46.710
I’m pretty much moved into my new place,
so my finale video will post monday night.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:51.430
On time for once, be sure to subscribe to
get it in case you’re just now finding me.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:55.650
In the meantime, you can click here for last
week’s episode and you can click here to

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:58.590
start getting ready for Arrow Season 3 and
The Flash.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:00.120
Those shows are coming back in october.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.650
Thanks for watching, see you guys tonight.

00:10:01.650 --> 00:10:02.089
High Fives!

